      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key: Only start counting from sequence START\nA number is a start if (num-1) is NOT in set\n\n100: 99 not in set -> start: 100,101? No -> streak=1\n4: 3 in set -> skip (not a start)\n200: 199 not in set -> streak=1\n1: 0 not in set -> start: 1,2,3,4? Yes -> streak=4\n3: 2 in set -> skip\n2: 1 in set -> skip",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
